Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.79,0:19:57.38,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\c1E1E1E}没事的  那些垂头丧气的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.38,0:19:58.80,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\c1E1E1E}也可爱无比
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.64,0:20:15.27,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}面对摇摆的蓝色烦扰
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.27,0:20:19.03,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}面对诱惑魔法的引力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.03,0:20:20.86,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}明明如此  如此
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.86,0:20:22.82,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}努力地抗拒着
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.82,0:20:24.32,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}可无论如何  不管怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.32,0:20:26.24,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}最终还是会败下阵来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.24,0:20:29.75,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\t(1000,2200,\cC22331)}如果现在能重新来过
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.75,0:20:33.25,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\cC22331}愿望如梦般短暂 {\fn\fscx\fscy}Rollin’
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.25,0:20:35.38,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\cC22331}但人生很长
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.38,0:20:39.67,EDCN,,0,0,27,,{\fad(180,180)\cC22331}偶尔迷茫又何妨{\fnA-OTF Shin Maru Go Pr6N DB\fs68}？
